{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-50202" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨{e}^{t}-4,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩$, then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-50202" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨{e}^{t}-4,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{t}-4,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int ({e}^{t}-4)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t}-4t+{c}_{1},\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t}-4t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t}-4t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-50202" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0fef3f7c6ec5a49384ab0b05d33ff36c1a9b9e5d77c113689d538d21c3845ef3"} {"question" "q-50202" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-50202" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-⟨{e}^{t}-4t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t},\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t}-4t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t}-4t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t}-4t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-50202" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{e}^{t}-4t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99264" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨5{t}^{4},\\,-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99264" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨\\text{ }5{t}^{4},\\,-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨5{t}^{4},\\,-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int 5{t}^{4}\\,\\text{d}t,\\int (-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}})\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{5}+{c}_{1},\\,\\frac{1}{t}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{5},\\,\\frac{1}{t}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{5},\\,\\frac{1}{t}⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99264" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0fef3f7c6ec5a49384ab0b05d33ff36c1a9b9e5d77c113689d538d21c3845ef3"} {"question" "q-99264" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99264" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨4{t}^{4},\\,\\frac{1}{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{4},\\,-\\frac{1}{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{4},\\,\\frac{3}{{t}^{3}}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{5},\\,-\\frac{1}{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{5},\\,\\frac{1}{t}⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99264" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{t}^{5},\\,\\frac{1}{t}⟩+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-80460" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨3{t}^{2},\\,{e}^{t}⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-80460" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨3{t}^{2},\\,{e}^{t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨3{t}^{2},\\,{e}^{t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int 3{t}^{2}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int {e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{3}+{c}_{1},\\,{e}^{t}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{3},\\,{e}^{t}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{3},\\,{e}^{t}⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-80460" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0fef3f7c6ec5a49384ab0b05d33ff36c1a9b9e5d77c113689d538d21c3845ef3"} {"question" "q-80460" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-80460" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨3{t}^{3},\\,t{e}^{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{{t}^{3}}{3},\\,{e}^{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{3},\\,-t{e}^{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{3},\\,-{e}^{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{3},\\,{e}^{t}⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-80460" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{t}^{3},\\,{e}^{t}⟩+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123224" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123224" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,-\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123224" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0fef3f7c6ec5a49384ab0b05d33ff36c1a9b9e5d77c113689d538d21c3845ef3"} {"question" "q-123224" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123224" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-\\operatorname{csc}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{csc}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123224" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123319" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨6{t}^{3}+8,\\,{e}^{t+1}⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123319" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨6{t}^{3}+8,\\,{e}^{t+1}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨6{t}^{3}+8,\\,{e}^{t+1}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int (6{t}^{3}+8)\\,\\text{d}t,\\int {e}^{t+1}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{3{t}^{4}}{2}+8t+{c}_{1},\\,{e}^{t+1}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{3{t}^{4}}{2}+8t,\\,{e}^{t+1}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{3{t}^{4}}{2}+8t,\\,{e}^{t+1}⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123319" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0fef3f7c6ec5a49384ab0b05d33ff36c1a9b9e5d77c113689d538d21c3845ef3"} {"question" "q-123319" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123319" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨\\frac{3t}{4}+8t,\\,{e}^{t+1}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{3{t}^{4}}{2}+8t,\\,{e}^{t+1}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{3{t}^{4}}{2}+8t,\\,{e}^{t-1}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{4{t}^{2}}{3},\\,{e}^{t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{{t}^{4}}{2}+8t,\\,{e}^{t+1}⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123319" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨\\frac{3{t}^{4}}{2}+8t,\\,{e}^{t+1}⟩+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123424" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $\\int ⟨4{csc}^{2}⁡t,\\,3{e}^{3t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123424" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨4{csc}^{2}⁡t,\\,3{e}^{3t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int 4{csc}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int 3{e}^{3t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4\\operatorname{cot}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,{e}^{3t}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,{e}^{3t}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-4\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,{e}^{3t}⟩+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123424" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0fef3f7c6ec5a49384ab0b05d33ff36c1a9b9e5d77c113689d538d21c3845ef3"} {"question" "q-123424" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123424" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,{e}^{3t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨-4\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,3{e}^{3t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨-4\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,{e}^{3t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨4\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,3{e}^{3t}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{sin}^{2}⁡t,\\,{e}^{3t}⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-123424" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-4\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,{e}^{3t}⟩+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99350" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,4\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99350" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,4\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t⟩\\text{d}t=⟨\\int {e}^{t}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int 4\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $x(t)={e}^{t},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int {e}^{t}\\text{d}t={e}^{t}+{c}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $y(t)=4\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t,$ we calculate its integral using substitution. So, we let $u=2t.$ Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t}=2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nTherefore,  we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int y(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =\\int 4\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int 4\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{2}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =2(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡u)+{c}_{2} \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t+{c}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{e}^{t},\\,4\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨{e}^{t}+{c}_{1},\\,-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t},\\,-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{e}^{t},\\,-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t⟩+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99350" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0fef3f7c6ec5a49384ab0b05d33ff36c1a9b9e5d77c113689d538d21c3845ef3"} {"question" "q-99350" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99350" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨e,\\,2+\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨t{e}^{t},\\,-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t},\\,-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t},\\,-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{e}^{t},\\,2-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99350" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨{e}^{t},\\,-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡2t⟩+C"] "category" "mode