, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}},\\,-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t\\operatorname{csc}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int \\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int -\\operatorname{cot}⁡t\\operatorname{csc}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{1}{t}+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{csc}⁡t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\operatorname{csc}⁡t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\operatorname{csc}⁡t⟩+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99268" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0fef3f7c6ec5a49384ab0b05d33ff36c1a9b9e5d77c113689d538d21c3845ef3"} {"question" "q-99268" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99268" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\operatorname{csc}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨-\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\operatorname{sec}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}},\\,\\operatorname{csc}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{1}{t},\\,-\\operatorname{csc}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\frac{1}{t},\\,{csc}^{2}⁡t⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-99268" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-\\frac{1}{t},\\,\\operatorname{csc}⁡t⟩+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-349150" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral of a vector-valued function. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{-1}^{3}⟨{t}^{2}+t,\\,2{t}^{3}-t⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨$\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}} $⟩$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-349150" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{3}⟨{t}^{2}+t,\\,2{t}^{3}-t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{-1}^{3}({t}^{2}+t)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{-1}^{3}(2{t}^{3}-t)\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the first component,\n\n$$\n\\int ({t}^{2}+t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{3}{t}^{3}+\\frac{1}{2}{t}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFor the second component,\n\n$$\n\\int (2{t}^{3}-t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{2}{t}^{4}-\\frac{1}{2}{t}^{2}.\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{3}⟨{t}^{2}+t,\\,2{t}^{3}-t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨(\\frac{1}{3}{t}^{3}+\\frac{1}{2}{t}^{2}){|}_{-1}^{3},\\,(\\frac{1}{2}{t}^{4}-\\frac{1}{2}{t}^{2}){|}_{-1}^{3}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(\\frac{1}{3}(27)+\\frac{1}{2}(9))-(\\frac{1}{3}(-1)+\\frac{1}{2}(1)),\\,(\\frac{1}{2}(81)-\\frac{1}{2}(9))-(\\frac{1}{2}(1)-\\frac{1}{2}(1))⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(9+\\frac{9}{2})-(-\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{2}),\\,(36)-0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{40}{3},\\,36⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{40}{3},\\,36⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-349150" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0fef3f7c6ec5a49384ab0b05d33ff36c1a9b9e5d77c113689d538d21c3845ef3"} {"question" "q-349150" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-349150" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{40}{3}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-349150" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-349150" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "36"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-349114" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral of a vector-valued function. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{1}^{8}⟨5t-2,\\,\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{t}^{2}}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t=⟨$\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}} $⟩$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-349114" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{8}⟨5t-2,\\,\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{t}^{2}}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{1}^{8}(5t-2)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{1}^{8}\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{t}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the first component, we integrate directly:\n\n$$\n\\int (5t-2)\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{5}{2}{t}^{2}-2t.\n$$\n\nFor the second component, we write \n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{t}^{2}}}=\\frac{1}{3}{t}^{-2/3}\n$$\n\nand integrate:\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{3}{t}^{-2/3}\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\frac{{t}^{1/3}}{1/3}={t}^{1/3}.\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{8}⟨5t-2,\\,\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{{t}^{2}}}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨(\\frac{5}{2}{t}^{2}-2t){|}_{1}^{8},\\,({t}^{1/3}){|}_{1}^{8}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(\\frac{5}{2}\\cdot 64-16)-(\\frac{5}{2}\\cdot 1-2),\\,2-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨144-\\frac{1}{2},\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{287}{2},\\,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{287}{2},\\,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d8d2ba74c481b79cbbc48481ed28ed7e46872ca92537cb737"} {"question" "q-349114" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0fef3f7c6ec5a49384ab0b05d33ff36c1a9b9e5d77c113689d538d21c3845ef3"} {"question" "q-349114" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14037744/state.json" "file_sha256" "3c90e7b8473ca00d